      {
        "action_date": "2025-10-31",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Keep America Building Act</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits federal funds from being used to (1) to suspend, delay, or interrupt all or part of the work of a project under a contract during any lapse in appropriations (i.e., government shutdown); or (2) stop all or any part of the work agreed to in the contract.&nbsp;</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-11-06T15:00:21Z"
      }
    ]
